ond have been tracking piggies and swinging the hammer this week. The demo just got an update I've been watching how people play, and I've patched the demo for the last weekend of the fest: The next rooms open much sooner, so you see more of the game in a short session Clearer help for your first few hands After a miss, it shows which piggy had the c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T16:11:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042225","verified_at":"2026-10-25T17:10:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5067010-1846018067933953","game_id":"steam-5067010","kind":"announcement","title":"The Piggy Monte free demo is out now","summary":"The free demo of Piggy Monte is out now, right here on the store page. Piggy Monte is a 3D shell game with piggy banks. A golden coin goes under one piggy, the piggies shuffle, and you smash the one you think has it with a steel hammer. Pick wrong and the piggy that had it spits your whole pot across the table. What's in the demo The first 4 of the game's 14 rooms, played by the same rules as the full game 5 upgrades from the back room shop Play money only, with nothing to buy in game The demo i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T16:31:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933953","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:25:12Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5067010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:24Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5067010":"2026-10-26T07:58:24Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5067010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:24Z","status":"ok","error_cod